This project generates tasks for, and is built against, tau2-bench:

    tau2-bench — https://github.com/sierra-research/tau2-bench
    MIT License
    Copyright (c) 2025 Sierra Research

tau2-gen does not vendor tau2-bench; it is cloned separately at install time and
used as a library (its telecom environment, tools, policy documents, user
simulator and scorer). The telecom fault definitions in
`domains/telecom/gen.py` follow the structure of tau2-bench's own programmatic
task pipeline (`tau2.domains.telecom.tasks`), re-implemented so that each task
can carry its own generated database.

`patches/0001-set_state-keep-separate-user-db.patch` is a modification of
tau2-bench source, applied to a local clone and not redistributed here.

No tau2-bench task data is copied into generated task sets. See "Not copying the
benchmark" in README.md.
